# LuicipherOS Vicinae v0.1 — primary Raycast-like launcher (SUPER+Space in lua/binds.lua).
# Vicinae is configured via its GUI (vicinae toggle -> Settings); this dir pins
# intent + documents the Hyprland bind. v0.2: clipboard + portal limits pass.
# Bind: SUPER+Space -> `vicinae toggle || fuzzel` (fallback keeps shell usable if
# the Vicinae daemon is not running). NOTE: Vicinae also ships its own built-in
# Alt+Space shortcut — that comes from Vicinae defaults, not this repo. Keep
# both, or disable the built-in under Vicinae Settings -> Preferences.
# lua/autostart.lua (best-effort, `|| true`).
# AUR: vicinae (see config/packages-arch). Flatpak: none upstream (see flatpaks-user.list comment).
